# M10 — keep Docker build context lean. node_modules is reinstalled
# fresh inside the v2builder stage via `npm ci`, and committed
# static/v2/ is overwritten by the v2builder's output before the Go
# build stage uses it — so neither needs to ride along in the
# context.
**/node_modules
static/redesign/app/dist
static/v2
